--- Item data used for categorization and inventory compression.  ---
--- The trade and skill based data is only a default, it will be  ---
--- calculated on the fly for characters that have those trades   ---
--- or skills.  But these defaults are helpful for getting all    ---
--- reagents into the proper categories.                          ---
---                                                               ---
--- DO NOT EDIT THIS FILE.  IT IS AUTO-GENERATED AND YOUR CHANGES ---
--- WILL BE OVERWRITTEN ON THE NEXT RELEASE OF THE ADDON!         ---
---------------------------------------------------------------------

local _G = getfenv(0)
